    [CI] Publish ubuntu nightly images to atlas_inference for north-4 sync (#19524)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    Ubuntu 'full' nightly builds now create their multi-arch manifests in
    both base_image/ascend-ci/vllm-ascend (the CI contract referenced by the
    test workflows) and atlas_inference/vllm-ascend, restoring the
    swr.cn-north-4 coverage that the retired daily pipeline provided. The
    cn-north-4 sync dispatch now fires whenever any variant merges instead
    of only for openEuler, and the push-status log lists both ubuntu
    destinations.
    
